":"Lab Report: Model comparison","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s1","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s2","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"We trained each model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 64.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s3","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"The dataset was split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s4","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s5","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"On IMDB, ViT-S is 2.4 points better than Baseline.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s6","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"On IMDB, ViT-S is 4.9 points better than CNN (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s7","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"ViT-S achieves 60.8% test accuracy on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s8","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s9","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"VGG-16 achieves 73.4% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s10","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"On SST-2, VGG-16 obtains a accuracy of 21.3%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s11","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"GRU scores 20.2 points higher on IMDB than on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s12","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"Figure 3 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s13","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"GRU achieves 67.8% accuracy on SVHN (Figure 3).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s14","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"On SVHN, GRU obtains a accuracy of 68%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s15","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"XGBoost reaches 91.8% accuracy on Fashion-MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_005_s16","report_id":"v3feat_005","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null}]}